Question: Query variation 187 regarding Rail Madad station complaints: The station toilet is dirty
Answer: Open the official Rail Madad portal: https://railmadad.indianrailways.gov.in/madad/final/home.jsp
Choose a station-related grievance, select the station and issue type, add a clear description, and submit it. Keep the generated reference number so that you can follow the complaint status.ÿÿÿÿ